    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d79">

                <pb facs="0233" n="115" sameAs="frus:frus1928v02/pg115"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">825.85/75: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Chile</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Collier</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-01-26T11:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">January 26,
                                1928—11 a.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 1:25
                    p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>22. Department’s 8, January 24, 6 p.m. I have finally after repeated
                    representations secured the withdrawal of objectionable provision <pb
                        facs="0234" n="116" xml:id="pg116"/> from the tariff bill and the bill thus
                    corrected has passed both Houses of Congress.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Collier</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
